    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11190" root="خل" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَلُّ</span></b>  <i>More,</i> and <i>most, poor,</i> or <i>needy:</i> (K,
TA:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَلَّ إِلَيْهِ</span> signifying “ he wanted it, ”
or “ needed it. ” (TA.) Hence the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَلُّ إِلَيْهِ</span>
[meaning <i>More,</i> or <i>most, in need of him,</i> or <i>it</i>].
(TA.) ― 
